X14 — secondary observations (non-blocking)
--------------------------------------------
(a) generation_catalog.rs:264-274 now runs a full DistannReadyReceipt::decode
    (SHA-256 over the canonical bytes plus validate) on EVERY generation catalog
    row read, including lookup_retained_generation_by_fingerprint, which is on
    the read path. generation_read.rs:1232 short-circuits through
